23:42.920 --> 23:44.050
Hamba tidak berani.

23:44.790 --> 23:45.920
Hamba mendengar

23:46.350 --> 23:48.240
Nyonya Bangsawan Kaiguo berjanji

23:48.240 --> 23:50.960
