36:30.920 --> 36:32.000
Jika percaya padaku,

36:30.950 --> 36:34.440
♪ Sepanjang hidupku hanya bagimu ♪

36:32.190 --> 36:33.230
saat bertanding di babak berikutnya,

36:33.230 --> 36:34.470
